SUMMARY:KidsZone
DESCRIPTION:A monthly in-person grief group for children ages 5–12 to express grief\, connect with peers\, and enhance coping skills through themed activities. \nKidsZone will be on summer break in July and August and will resume in October following Camp BRIGHT in September. \nRegistration required by calling 919-719-7199 or emailing kidsgrief@transitionslifecare.org.
URL:https://www.transitionslifecare.org/event/kidszone-3/
LOCATION:Transitions LifeCare\, 250 Hospice Circle\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27607\, United States
CATEGORIES:Grief Support,Kids Events
